-b6af9c99bfe7": {"memory_id": "d78a50f8-09b9-4a7c-8be0-b6af9c99bfe7", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Japan main talk has 21 core slides after merging Proof 2 architecture, choreography, and response timeline into one control-plane slide.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T12:23:33.993137", "importance": 0.6, "metadata": {"source_agent": "unknown", "source_file": "headroom_japan_main_talk_has_21_core_slides_after_merging_p.md", "content_hash": "b368f2920702c0b4", "synced_at": "2026-07-24T12:23:33.992598+00:00", "sync_direction": "import", "name": "Japan main talk has 21 core slides after merging Proof 2 arc", "description": "Japan main talk has 21 core slides after merging Proof 2 architecture, choreography, and response ti", "headroom_id": "21eed122-1b2b-4985-9069-40f7b4c811c5"}}, "2d36a9b9-c6d0-47d8-b45c-c73fd81a05a5": {"memory_id": "2d36a9b9-c6d0-47d8-b45c-c73fd81a05a5", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Verification for the network change: presentation-japan main-talk rendering source test and production Vite build pass; a Playwright screenshot visually verified slide 2. The full main-talk browser script currently fails at its off-screen TokyoDuckCurve locator after navigation, a brittle unrelated assertion that pre-dates/extends beyond slide 2.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T12:18:42.391987", "importance": 0.7, "metadata": {}}, "8be68583-5bf4-4ded-9b59-8c6dfbc0a576": {"memory_id": "8be68583-5bf4-4ded-9b59-8c6dfbc0a576", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "2026-07-24: MainTalk slide 2 uses reusable CapabilityMotif variant='network'. It presents Grid Today -> Batteries + Internet -> New Capabilities, uses existing Anime.js pulses and SlideContext active gating, and has three authored states via StepBridge count={2} (initial render plus two advances).", "created_at": "2026-07-24T12:18:42.166974", "importance": 0.7, "metadata": {}}, "bc216837-115b-4941-a85f-22bb82a886e0": {"memory_id": "bc216837-115b-4941-a85f-22bb82a886e0", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "CapabilityMotif is wired into 'Store it for later' and 'Respond when the system is tight' as compact two-column slides; rendering test, browser test, and production build passed. No commit.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T11:16:46.594214", "importance": 0.7, "metadata": {}}, "8417e603-a79c-4009-b271-bec7f6bb0a07": {"memory_id": "8417e603-a79c-4009-b271-bec7f6bb0a07", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Added reusable presentation-japan/src/components/CapabilityMotif.jsx using existing useAnimeTimeline/Anime.js, with store (sun\u2192battery\u2192home) and respond (alert grid\u2192EV/home/battery) variants.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T11:16:46.417551", "importance": 0.7, "metadata": {}}, "4311f959-5607-40cc-8d04-4734f892e122": {"memory_id": "4311f959-5607-40cc-8d04-4734f892e122", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "2026-07-24: MainTalk now has 21 slides; the redundant 'A Japanese platform for that flexibility' slide was removed.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T11:16:46.218549", "importance": 0.8, "metadata": {}}, "646ea93a-bb7e-4c5a-902c-66065dfe1604": {"memory_id": "646ea93a-bb7e-4c5a-902c-66065dfe1604", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Japan MainTalk now has 22 core slides. A restored transition slide appears immediately before 'A real noon operating constraint': eyebrow 'PROOF 1 \u00b7 MARKET PARTICIPATION', title 'Bring new players into the market', copy on batteries/EVs/homes becoming trusted coordinated grid resources. Rendering/browser checks and build were run successfully on 2026-07-24.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T10:59:34.608278", "importance": 0.8, "metadata": {}}, "51816e90-0e1c-46ef-92a2-1f125956d053": {"memory_id": "51816e90-0e1c-46ef-92a2-1f125956d053", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Japan 50/60 Hz map copy must describe HVDC as controllable scheduled transfer, not a permanently synchronized or always-flowing connection.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T10:40:11.144047", "importance": 0.9, "metadata": {}}, "7b16be6d-351d-4218-acba-07ea7035f6b8": {"memory_id": "7b16be6d-351d-4218-acba-07ea7035f6b8", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Full-bleed MainTalk slides must explicitly set Slide backgroundColor to the matching dark or washi color; otherwise Spectacle falls back to cyan tertiary and creates a jarring frame.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T10:16:50.929198", "importance": 0.9, "metadata": {}}, "92c76916-7882-448b-805a-926dddcabcd8": {"memory_id": "92c76916-7882-448b-805a-926dddcabcd8", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Tokyo duck-curve slide spreads its 320 synthetic household-device markers over 16 approximate real Tokyo neighborhood centroids using deterministic irregular offsets; customer locations are not implied.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T10:12:22.397697", "importance": 0.9, "metadata": {}}, "4858c30c-a008-4bc6-a585-66aaee1106e1": {"memory_id": "4858c30c-a008-4bc6-a585-66aaee1106e1", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Public Shizen Connect source supported a 186-household EV V2H demonstration but did not publish the fleet count for the Tokyo 2026 demand-creation case.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T10:08:27.928319", "importance": 0.9, "metadata": {}}, "f8a145b3-560d-4058-a697-9716e04435e6": {"memory_id": "f8a145b3-560d-4058-a697-9716e04435e6", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Tokyo duck-curve active charging step zooms to 11.2 and labels the household distribution as illustrative synthetic data.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T10:08:27.751946", "importance": 0.9, "metadata": {}}, "d580ba0d-0e13-486b-9f7b-98871e241b1b": {"memory_id": "d580ba0d-0e13-486b-9f7b-98871e241b1b", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "FEPC 2025 report was downloaded for reference but local pdftotext is unavailable; browser-safe named feature data remains a presentation-scale curated layer, not engineering GIS.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T08:00:11.031849", "importance": 0.82, "metadata": {}}, "8b8a63aa-b610-438e-80ed-c1868cd4a3a0": {"memory_id": "8b8a63aa-b610-438e-80ed-c1868cd4a3a0", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Atlas plant markers use fuel-specific colors and Deck.gl hover tooltips that show plant name, fuel, and rounded capacity.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T08:00:10.826376", "importance": 0.82, "metadata": {}}, "bd70ee20-b070-415f-8aea-81015070e10a": {"memory_id": "bd70ee20-b070-415f-8aea-81015070e10a", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "JapanGridAtlas now contains 24 generalized named transmission corridors with per-feature FEPC 2025 or GENI source attribution.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T08:00:10.651751", "importance": 0.82, "metadata": {}}, "24205a6b-4ba8-4f47-8e97-d934fbc804bf": {"memory_id": "24205a6b-4ba8-4f47-8e97-d934fbc804bf", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "JapanGridAtlas now contains 44 named static plants spanning Nuclear, LNG, Coal, Oil, Hydro, Geothermal, Solar, and Wind.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T08:00:10.471153", "importance": 0.82, "metadata": {}}, "6f7a4a5a-ec6a-4146-84ff-e8cde5b15bd9": {"memory_id": "6f7a4a5a-ec6a-4146-84ff-e8cde5b15bd9", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "2026-07-24: Implemented reusable JapanGridAtlas for presentation-japan. It is a Deck.gl + MapLibre component with compact icon HUD, per-step preset defaults, local click overrides reset on step changes, static cited layers for mix/plants/provider areas/transmission, and unavailable hooks for demand/JEPX. Keynote includes an atlas slide after opening; MainTalk's first two maps reuse atlas. Provider-area polygons are explicitly schematic because no licensed georeferenced boundary data was confirmed. No commit.", "created_at": "2026-07-24T07:46:10.641540", "importance": 0.7, "metadata": {}}, "ac198673-5177-4e08-be27-6b54db501c90": {"memory_id": "ac198673-5177-4e08-be27-6b54db501c90", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "User asked to disable lean-ctx while working in the kubecon-2026-vpp repository.", "created_at": "2026-07-23T14:23:18.517799", "importance": 0.85, "metadata": {}}, "80f06810-7451-41a5-8857-d7751a848f7f": {"memory_id": "80f06810-7451-41a5-8857-d7751a848f7f", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Japan main talk Proof 2 (documented March 2022 Tokyo supply-demand map): user approved replacing the small SVG pressure trace with the established canvas DuckCurveHUD. It renders an explicitly labeled illustrative winter demand profile, highlights [12,18,16,19]h by authored incident state, and makes no quantitative/event causality claim.", "created_at": "2026-07-23T13:43:12.339674", "importance": 0.7, "metadata": {}}, "8032accb-7d9d-430b-